From 0ffea1de6a51ca0f313d715ccd9b44c0120b99d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zingzy <zingzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:44:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] gpui_linux: render_to_image for X11 and Wayland windows

Window::render_to_image only worked on macOS and Windows, so tools could
not capture a real window on Linux. The window renderer now draws its
scene into an offscreen texture with its own pipelines and atlas, and the
readback is shared with the headless renderer.
